# CL-ROI-VCM: Project Context (Palette_v2)

## Research identity
- Owner: Minh (NCS, UET-VNU)
- Repo: https://github.com/NgocMinhUET/Palette_v2
- Active branch: `feature/cl-roi-vcm` (committed and pushed)

## What this project is
Extension of the released Palette A3C backbone (human RTVC) toward **Video Coding for Machines (VCM)**.  
**This is NOT a full WebRTC/Echo reproduction of Palette.**  
It is a trace-driven VCM simulator + task-aware A3C controller.

## Key design decisions (do not change without asking Minh)

| Aspect | Palette (original) | CL-ROI-VCM (new) |
|--------|--------------------|-----------------|
| State | SI/TI, CRF, delay, loss | 9-D: `[bw, rtt, loss, qp_prev, bitrate_prev, roi_area, obj_count, mean_conf, motion]` |
| Action | delta-CRF (7 steps) | `[QP_base ∈ {24,28,32,36,40}] × [roi_offset ∈ {-6,-3,0,3}]` → A_DIM=20 |
| Reward | human QoE | `α·u_task_hat − β·bitrate − γ·delay` — **NO mAP online** |
| Env | your_env.py (missing) | `vcm/vcm_env.py` CSV-driven trace simulator |
| Agent | `a3c_agent.py` TF1+tflearn | `vcm/a3c_agent_vcm.py` same backbone, S_INFO=9 |

## Critical invariant
- **`u_task_hat`** = online reward signal (heuristic or sklearn-regressor).  
- **`u_task_gt`** = offline-only (CSV profile, oracle policy, evaluation). Never used as RL reward.  
- **mAP** is never computed online.

## File layout

```
Palette_v2/
├── train_palette.py, a3c_agent.py, load_trace.py   ← originals, DO NOT MODIFY
├── requirements.txt                                  ← TF1.15, tflearn, multiprocess
├── requirements_vcm.txt                              ← adds scikit-learn
├── vcm/
│   ├── vcm_config.py          S_INFO=9, A_DIM=20, decode_action, reward fns
│   ├── a3c_agent_vcm.py       TF1.x+tflearn, split_net[0:3]+split_task[3:9], GRU-16
│   ├── vcm_env.py             CSV lookup + trace bandwidth overlay
│   ├── task_utility_estimator.py   heuristic → RF/MLP when sklearn present
│   ├── roi_task_extractor.py  summarize_from_boxes (geometry + motion proxy)
│   ├── build_dummy_offline_profile.py  10 videos × 600 frames × 20 actions = 120k rows
│   ├── train_vcm.py           A3C train; --num_agents 1 for single-process
│   ├── test_vcm.py            policies: rl|uniform_qp|fixed_roi|random|oracle
│   ├── evaluate_vcm.py        summary table + task_per_bitrate metric
│   └── README_VCM.md
├── data/offline_profiles/dummy_vcm_profile.csv   (gitignored, regenerate via build script)
└── results/vcm_logs/, results/vcm_models/        (gitignored)
```

## How to run on server

```bash
git clone https://github.com/NgocMinhUET/Palette_v2.git
cd Palette_v2
git checkout feature/cl-roi-vcm
pip install -r requirements.txt
pip install -r requirements_vcm.txt   # optional sklearn

python vcm/build_dummy_offline_profile.py

python vcm/train_vcm.py \
  --profile_csv data/offline_profiles/dummy_vcm_profile.csv \
  --trace_dir traces \
  --num_agents 1 \
  --episodes 400 \
  --log_dir results/vcm_logs \
  --model_dir results/vcm_models

python vcm/test_vcm.py --policy oracle     --max_steps 4000
python vcm/test_vcm.py --policy uniform_qp --max_steps 4000
python vcm/test_vcm.py --policy fixed_roi  --max_steps 4000
python vcm/test_vcm.py --policy rl \
  --model_path results/vcm_models/nn_model_ep_400.ckpt --max_steps 4000

python vcm/evaluate_vcm.py
```

## What is synthetic / to replace with real data

| Item | Status | How to replace |
|------|--------|----------------|
| `dummy_vcm_profile.csv` | Synthetic | Re-encode real videos; fill rows via `roi_task_extractor` + detector output |
| `u_task_gt` | Formula-based | Compute offline: mAP/IDF1/mIoU per (video, frame, qp_base, delta_qp_roi) |
| `u_task_hat` | Heuristic | `TaskUtilityEstimator.fit_from_csv(real_profile.csv)` with sklearn |
| Bandwidth traces | Falls back to CSV | Supply real RMCAT/5G traces in `traces/` (timestamp bw format) |

